# Provider envs
provider_containers/**/.env.*
!provider_containers/**/.env.example
# The remote agent's live token file. `.env` (line 2) matches at any depth but
# NOT `.env.agent`, and `docs/deployment.md`, `remote_agent/README.md` and
# `remote_agent/docker-compose.yml` all instruct you to create it holding a real
# `REMOTE_AGENT_TOKEN` — so it was a one-command commit of a credential.
remote_agent/.env.agent
remote_agent/**/.env.*
!remote_agent/**/.env.example*
