# The TTS provider's env file. Listed separately because `.env.modal-*` does NOT
# cover it: the file is `.env.tts-modal-hp196`, which starts `tts-`, not `modal-`.
# It holds the same live MODAL_TOKEN_ID / MODAL_TOKEN_SECRET / PROVIDER_WORKER_TOKEN
# as the other providers, so failing to match it means committing credentials.
# An earlier version of this change did exactly that.
.env.tts-*
